{"id": "4243658959", "title": "DeepSeek(R1) vs Gpt-o3-mini(-high)", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5Mzk3NTE0Mw==&mid=2247483715&idx=1&sn=8f936ef2f0c039f3e1d7bbf3d7bf66df", "accountName": "Moonlight Bug Hunter", "author": "Moonlight Bug Hunter", "date": "2月2日", "ts": 1738499880000, "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bPGqVWskPL8F0UVxtR4LnCcmhFLD791UkdAMyLcelicgpnBKf66M8gQ79GQpEAWcCN7rLfYw3Wangowcaft0Iwg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "summary": "原创 XiaoC 2025-02-02 20:38 北京 \n昨儿看到 gpt 放出了 o3-mini 和 o3-mini-high 模型，用两年前问 gpt4 的漏洞 demo 丢给 dsr1 和 o3 测了下。 \n问题：下面是一个 web 程序，其中可能存在一些漏洞，找出所有的漏洞，和触发漏洞的路径，给出 poc \nfrom flask import  Flask \nfrom flask imp", "content": [{"type": "p", "text": "原创 XiaoC 2025-02-02 20:38 北京"}, {"type": "p", "text": "昨儿看到 gpt 放出了 o3-mini 和 o3-mini-high 模型，用两年前问 gpt4 的漏洞 demo 丢给 dsr1 和 o3 测了下。"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bPGqVWskPL8F0UVxtR4LnCcmhFLD791UkdAMyLcelicgpnBKf66M8gQ79GQpEAWcCN7rLfYw3Wangowcaft0Iwg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 1}, {"type": "p", "text": "问题：下面是一个 web 程序，其中可能存在一些漏洞，找出所有的漏洞，和触发漏洞的路径，给出 poc"}, {"type": "p", "text": "from flask import  Flask"}, {"type": "p", "text": "from flask import request"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bPGqVWskPL8F0UVxtR4LnCcmhFLD791UBs8aRb3d9NbUciaoJ3sOYJiasKSWibBCa6W1AL9jhZ724YfVSIQmvyy6g/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "from jinja2.sandbox import  SandboxedEnvironment"}, {"type": "p", "text": "from jinja2 import  Environment"}, {"type": "p", "text": "from jinja2 import  Template"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bPGqVWskPL8F0UVxtR4LnCcmhFLD791UnWSKiaCxWq6xc8l97y4WowS0UZ5xa3W5AJcvzVBqChm7oZytBvfQyYA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "import uuid"}, {"type": "p", "text": "app =  Flask (__name__)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "class   MyTemplate ( Template ) :"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bPGqVWskPL8F0UVxtR4LnCcmhFLD791UnNcia1kbibhCjjTTMcVWrJqZcadY5y7Vlzofre5FIkqPbkWZ6dicJy6Vg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   xiaoc ( self ) :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "print( \"xiaoc called of MyTemplate\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "class   MyEnvironment ( Environment ) :"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bPGqVWskPL8F0UVxtR4LnCcmhFLD791UBs8aRb3d9NbUciaoJ3sOYJiasKSWibBCa6W1AL9jhZ724YfVSIQmvyy6g/640?wx_fmt=png", "caption": "", "_imgCount": true}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   xiaoc ( self ) :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "print( \"xiaoc called of MyEnvironment\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "class   MySandboxedEnvironment ( SandboxedEnvironment ) :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   xiaoc ( self ) :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "print( \"xiaoc called of SandboxedEnvironment\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test1' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test1 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "template =  Template (tpl)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return  template.render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test11' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test11 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return   Template (tpl).render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test2' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test2 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "env =  Environment ()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "template = env.from_string(tpl)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return  template.render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test21' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test21 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "template =  Environment ().from_string(tpl)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return  template.render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test22' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test22 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "env =  Environment ()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return  env.from_string(tpl).render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test23' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test23 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return   Environment ().from_string(tpl).render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test3' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test3 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "env =  SandboxedEnvironment ()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "template = env.from_string(tpl)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return  template.render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test4' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test4 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "kwargs = {}"}, {"type": "p", "text": "kwargs.update({ \"uuid\" : uuid})"}, {"type": "p", "text": "env =  SandboxedEnvironment ()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "template = env.from_string(tpl)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return  template.render(kwargs)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test5' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test5 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return   MyTemplate (tpl).render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test6' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test6 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return   MyEnvironment ().from_string(tpl).render()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "@app .route( '/test7' , methods=[ 'GET' ])"}, {"type": "p", "text": "def   test7 () :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "tpl = request.args.get( \"tpl\" )"}, {"type": "p", "text": "kwargs = {}"}, {"type": "p", "text": "kwargs.update({ \"uuid\" : uuid})"}, {"type": "p", "text": "return   MySandboxedEnvironment ().from_string(tpl).render(kwargs)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "if  __name__ ==  '__main__' :"}, {"type": "p", "text": "app.run()"}, {"type": "p", "text": "o3-mini-high  的表现"}, {"type": "p", "text": "能根据是否用沙箱分类 1*、2*、5、6 和 3、4、7"}, {"type": "p", "text": "在沙箱场景中，能识别出 uuid 变量的关键作用，但是在怎么利用 uuid 这个点，依然会陷入混乱，甚至觉得 test3 也能 bypass"}, {"type": "p", "text": "DeepSeek(R1)  的表现"}, {"type": "p", "text": "很惊艳，直接上截图。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "准确分类，无沙箱场景表现正常"}, {"type": "p", "text": "精确识别 uuid 变量的作用，甚至给了有无回显两种方式"}, {"type": "p", "text": "最后的总结，排除了唯一无漏洞路由 test3"}, {"type": "p", "text": "结论"}, {"type": "p", "text": "只从这个测试结果看，dsr1 秒了 gpt 当前公开的最强模型 o3-mini*。因此至少，dsr1 不弱于 gpt 当前的公开模型，可以停止给 gpt 续费了 xdm。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "跳转微信打开"}], "body": null}